* Fixed a hardware detection problem that could cause shadow mapping not to render correctly on ATI hardware. (A hacky workaround has to be used on ATI hardware because &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;GL_ARB_fragment_program_shadow&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; does not function correctly.&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
