* Added a validation function to the &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;PropertyRegistration&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; class so that property subclasses could identify which types of nodes they are supposed to be used with. This works in the same way that the validation function works for controllers. The validation function is only used to determine which available properties to list for a particular node in the Get Info dialog.&lt;br /&gt;
 &lt;br /&gt;
