&lt;br /&gt;
* Added &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;Cone&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; geometry class to the World Builder.&lt;br /&gt;
* Implemented collision detection for cone structures.&lt;br /&gt;
* Added maximum slope cut-off in the collision detection system. This prevents characters from walking up inclines that are too steep.&lt;br /&gt;
* Added better controls for curved surface subdivision to the World Builder.&lt;br /&gt;
* Added support for alternate texture map and light map natural parameterizations to the World Builder.&lt;br /&gt;
* Improved Sound Manager performance a bit.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
