* Implemented general surface marking system. Scorch marks and blood splatters can now be applied to any surface in the game.&lt;br /&gt;
* Added normalize render state to the &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;Renderable&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; class. This enables or disables the &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;GL_NORMALIZE&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; state.&lt;br /&gt;
